  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Song Taaba Sesame Production Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to allow the group to become more independent and take over some of the roles of SERACOM. Funds will be used for constructing warehouses; agricultural equipmentand trainings in seed production; sesame production; management and finance.</narrative>
  </description>
